**GAP-030 (docs-only fix, option B):** The docs claimed CLI webhook/inotify schedule support that never existed — the `Schedule` struct is cron-only and the CLI has no webhook/inotify flags. The fix corrects `README.md` and `INTEGRATION.md` to describe the actual reality, with zero code changes.

**1. Corrected `Schedule` reality (reference — unchanged code):**

```go
// Schedule controls when a workflow runs. Scheduling is cron-only:
// webhook and inotify (file-watch) triggers are not supported.
type Schedule struct {
	// Cron is a standard 5-field cron expression:
	// "minute hour day-of-month month day-of-week".
	Cron string `json:"cron"`
}
```

